st issue, reviewed log formatting\n\n- burst issue: realized that the guarantee of \"non-concurrency\" only applies to\n  updates going though the updater, but not the job queue. i think this is a bit\n  of an oversight by the developers, but that's that.\n- log formatting: simplified the structure, all lines have datestamp, tabs mostly\n  represent the hierarchy, and different requests are separated by newlines.\n  also, concurrent requests (handled with asyncio.lock) have a randomly generated\n  ID to tie them together", "created_at": "2024-04-12T20:33:12Z", "repo": "citof-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ad7cacf0a53c200f694db019b7b42c29b25bedd6", "message": "whoops", "created_at": "2024-03-22T22:50:02Z", "repo": "citof-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25b810dbfa4c54064a16c9ccbc51ee7fa4925733", "message": "apparently you can just turn off concurrency... fuck me i guess. reviewed errors, removed locks, hopefully now it's done", "created_at": "2024-03-22T22:17:25Z", "repo": "citof-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b4688a65ec9c67a7df1d3ff42533c19eee36e76c", "message": "quick and dirty fix to avoid hiding info from admin because of missing tags in messages...", "created_at": "2024-03-22T17:59:16Z", "repo": "citof-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2abf144e65b85c4684496f1aecaa5ba8954a8b66", "message": "lock is needed when opening gate as well...", "created_at": "2024-03-22T17:52:36Z", "repo": "citof-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b32bbb152a60e02689e85cbd5f9f36374b785aa0", "message": "included lock to prevent multiple notifications, reviewed error handling", "created_at": "2024-03-21T23:47:43Z", "repo": "citof-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5588aff641e6f6c00534df